  "descriptionMarkdown": "**Features:**\n* Automatically keeps U-235 until it has enough, and then doesn't take any more.\n* A far more UPS efficient chest-passing system for U-235 and U-238.\n* Tileable.\n* Once it starts, kovarex can't accidentally dump its needed U-235 by power outages, bot behavior, or belts going off to do naughty things.\n* 8-beacon (+500%), but modules/beacons can easily be removed from the print for early game.\n* Doesn't use logistics network, so it won't create infinite amounts of U-235, only enough to fill the belt.\n\n**Instructions:**\n* Connect U-235 and U-238 belts.\n* To simplify and improve UPS at any point after kovarex is running, simply:\n     * delete U-235 belt to chest inserter\n     * THEN delete combinator\n",
